{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/label_33.json","id":43988,"nhanesId":"","bundleName":"","fullName":"Amplified 100% Whey Protein","brandName":"GNC Pro Performance","brandIpSymbol":"®","upcSku":"0 48107 09081 4","productVersionCode":"CODE 351193 HLG","pdf":"","thumbnail":"","servingsPerContainer":"12","hasOuterCarton":false,"percentDvFootnote":"Percent Daily Values are based on a 2,000 calorie diet.","labelRelationships":[{"type":"Flavor difference","labelId":18501}],"contacts":[{"contactId":1193,"text":"For More Information","types":["Other"],"contactDetails":{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/contact_1.json","id":1193,"name":"","streetAddress":"","city":"","state":"","country":"","zipCode":"","phoneNumber":"1-888-462-2548","email":"","webAddress":""}},{"contactId":1222,"text":"Distributed by","types":["Distributor"],"contactDetails":{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/contact_1.json","id":1222,"name":"General Nutrition Corporation","streetAddress":"","city":"Pittsburgh","state":"PA","country":"","zipCode":"15222","phoneNumber":"","email":"","webAddress":""}},{"contactId":1249,"text":"SHOP NOW @","types":["Other"],"contactDetails":{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/contact_1.json","id":1249,"name":"","streetAddress":"","city":"","state":"","country":"","zipCode":"","phoneNumber":"","email":"","webAddress":"GNC.COM"}}],"netContents":[{"order":1,"quantity":16,"unit":"oz.","display":"16 oz."},{"order":2,"quantity":1,"unit":"lb","display":"1 lb"},{"order":3,"quantity":454,"unit":"Gram(s)","display":"454 Gram(s)"}],"physicalState":{"langualCode":"E0162","langualCodeDescription":"Powder"},"servingSizes":[{"order":1,"minQuantity":36.5,"maxQuantity":36.5,"minDailyServings":2,"maxDailyServings":2,"unit":"Gram(s)","notes":"1 scoop","inSFB":true}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)"],"productType":{"langualCode":"A1325","langualCodeDescription":"Other Combinations"},"statements":[{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"The Proof is in the Amino Absorption-And More... Faster Absorption of Critical Amino Acids for Muscle Fuel: A Clinical study has proven that the proprietary protein blend in Amplified 100% Whey Protein delivers more critical aminos into the blood stream- better and faster then regular whey.~ Compared to regular whey protein, two servings of AMPlified 100% Whey Protein maximized amino acid absorption by delivering: ~ 107% More Total Amino Acids~- These critical amino acids are crucial to feeding your muscles before, during and after exercise.* ~114% More Branched Chain Amino Acids Absorbed 142% Faster!~- BCAA are involved in reducing the amount of protein breakdown from exercise and help to preserve muscle glycogen stores.* ~ 234% More Leucine Absorbed 370% Faster!~- Leucine is a key branched chain amino acid that is essential to fueling your muscles.* Its key role is to help regulation of muscle protein synthesis during muscle building and recovery.* This key amino acid is important for all types of athletes.\n"},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"KEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Micronized protein + amino acids"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary supplement"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"~20g of Protein featuring Micronized Whey, hydrolysates and 22.5g of Amino Acids\n"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"^When used in conjunction with a resistance training program."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Daily Power Strength Recovery"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Clinically Researched"},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"CODE 351193 HLG"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"DIRECTIONS: As a dietary supplement, add one level scoop (36.5g) of Pro Performance(R) AMP Amplified 100% Whey Protein to 7-8 fl. oz. cold water and blend well. For maximum results, take twice daily."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"CONTAINS: Milk, Soybeans and Wheat."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"CONTAINS: Milk, Soybeans and Wheat."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"NOTICE: Use this product as a food supplement only. Do not use for weight reduction."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Bio-Core Edge(TM) is a trademark of National Enzyme Company."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Sunfiber(R) is a registered trademark of Taiyo International, Inc. Use of Sunfiber(R) is protected by US Trademark Registration No. 2,930,937."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"What is Amplified 100% Whey Protein and Why is it Better than Regular Whey? Think ordinary whey protein is good enough? Think again. Introducing the latest breakthrough in whey! Amplified 100% Whey Protein features technology- enhanced protein with hydrolysates clinically proven to deliver more amino acids into the blood stream- better and faster than regular whey!~ The result... more amino acids are available for muscle fuel! These critical amino acids support athletic strength, performance, endurance and recovery.* This is the cutting-edge protein product that delivers a whole new level of protein technology."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"The Amplified 100% Whey Protein Evolution\nWhat makes this protein AMPlified? Using cutting edge technology and top notch research and development principles, this protein was designed to be the new champion of the whey protein category. Micronized Protein with Hydrolysates and Amino Acids- This premium whey features micronized whey protein with hydrolysates, leucine and glutamine!"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Amino Acceleration System- To make this protein even more absorbable, a unique digestive enzyme blend was included as an Amino Acceleration System. These efficacious enzymes were scientifically designed to further accelerate the availability of amino acids for absorption. More Key Aminos- In addition to an impressive 4.5 grams of leucine for muscle protein synthesis and 3.5 grams of glutamine to support the recovery process, this formula is loaded with an array of aminos necessary for your muscles before, during and after workouts.*"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Tri-MG(TM)- Amplified 100% Whey Protein is enhanced with this unique clinically studied ingredient, also known as betaine or trimethylglycine, which has been shown to enhance athletic performance.*"},{"type":"Formula re: Type","notes":"Who Can Benefit from taking amplified 100% Whey Protein? Everyone including athletes, fitness enthusiasts and extreme sports competitors who are exercising regularly and looking for a fast-absorbing quality protein to help meet protein needs can benefit from AMPlified 100% Whey Protein."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"~107% Better Absorption of Total Amino Acids~ 234% Better Absorption of Leucine~ Formulated to Build Lean Muscle^\n"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"AMP ADVANCED MUSCLE PERFORMANCE"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"NEW"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"When Should I Take It? Consume GNC Pro Performance(R) AMP Amplified 100% Whey Protein with or between meals to add more quality protein to your diet."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"^ In a randomized, double blind, controlled cross-over study of 16 healthy male volunteers, subjects experienced significantly higher maximum concentrations of Total Amino Acids, Branched Chain Amino Acids and Leucine one hour post-ingestion of two servings of the protein blend in GNC Pro Performance(R) AMP Amplified 100% Whey Protein relative to amino acid concentrations measured post-ingestion of whey protein concentrate."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"TYPICAL AMINO ACID PROFILE PER SERVING Alanine 444 mg Arginine 955 mg Aspartate 2400 mg Cyctine 516 mg Glutamine 3513 mg Glycine 345 mg Histidine 355 mg Isoleucine+ 1200 mg Leucine+ 4502 mg Lysine 1721 mg Methionine 442 mg Phenylalanine 652 mg Proline 1123 mg Serine 944 mg Threonine 1311 mg Tryptophan 384 mg Tyrosine 578 mg Valine+ 1115 mg Total 22500 mg +Indicates Branched Chain Amino Acids (BCAA) Denotes naturally occurring and added free form amino acids."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Significant differences for the Rate of Change of BCAA and Leucine absorption were also observed relative to the control group."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Significant product settling may occur."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Using MicroSorb(TM) Amino Technology, the micronized whey protein and amino acids in this formula have been pulverized into smaller particles that are easier to absorb."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"As a result, Amplified 100% Whey Protein is proven to deliver superior amino acid uptake compared to regular whey.~  That means more amino acids are available for your muscles to use as fuel! These key amino acids all support proteins involved in muscle building, recovery and other key processes crucial to your muscles.*"}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2015-05-22","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"ing